{"t":"NI","made":"2026-11-12 00:07","name":"NiSource Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Gas","employees":7668,"hq":"Merrillville, IN, United States","website":"https://www.nisource.com","summary_en":"NiSource Inc., an energy holding company, operates as a regulated natural gas and electric utility company in the United States. It operates in two segments, Columbia Operations and NIPSCO Operations. The company provides natural gas to residential, commercial, and industrial customers through approximately 37,300 miles of distribution main pipeline and the associated individual customer service lines; and 310 miles of transmission main pipeline in Ohio, Pennsylvania, Virginia, Kentucky, and Maryland. It also generates, transmits, and distributes electricity to approximately 0.5 million customers in various counties in the northern part of Indiana, as well as engages in wholesale electric and transmission transactions. It owns and operates steam coal generating stations in Wheatfield and Michigan City; combined cycle gas turbine in West Terre Haute; natural gas generating units in Wheatfield; hydro generating plants in Carroll County and White County; wind generating units in White County; and solar generating units in Sullivan County, Gibson County, Jasper County, and White County. The company was formerly known as NIPSCO Industries, Inc. and changed its name to NiSource Inc. in April 1999. NiSource Inc. was founded in 1847 and is headquartered in Merrillville, Indiana.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"에너지 지주 회사인 NiSource Inc.는 미국에서 규제 대상 천연가스 및 전기 유틸리티 회사로 운영됩니다. Columbia Operations와 NIPSCO Operations의 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 약 37,300마일에 달하는 주요 유통 파이프라인과 관련 개별 ​​고객 서비스 라인을 통해 주거용, 상업용 및 산업용 고객에게 천연가스를 제공합니다. 오하이오, 펜실베이니아, 버지니아, 켄터키, 메릴랜드에 310마일의 송전 주 파이프라인이 있습니다. 또한 인디애나 북부의 다양한 카운티에 있는 약 50만 명의 고객에게 전기를 생성, 송전 및 배전하고 전기 도매 및 송전 거래에도 참여하고 있습니다. Wheatfield와 Michigan City에 증기탄 발전소를 소유하고 운영하고 있습니다. West Terre Haute의 복합 사이클 가스 터빈; Wheatfield의 천연가스 생성 장치; Carroll 카운티 및 White 카운티의 수력 발전소; 화이트 카운티의 풍력 발전 시설; Sullivan 카운티, Gibson 카운티, Jasper 카운티 및 White 카운티의 태양광 발전 장치. 이 회사는 이전에 NIPSCO Industries, Inc.로 알려졌으며 1999년 4월에 NiSource Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. NiSource Inc.는 1847년에 설립되었으며 인디애나주 메릴빌에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":45.29,"mcap":21724192768.0,"pe":23.225641,"fpe":20.061127,"peg":2.6022,"ps":3.122279,"pb":2.2693791,"ev_ebitda":13.637,"div":2.65,"beta":0.536,"hi52":49.21,"lo52":38.42},"fin":{"rev":6957799936.0,"rev_g":0.06,"eps_g":0.346,"gross":0.50918,"op":0.27379,"net":0.13509,"roe":0.08713,"fcf":-2224987392.0,"cash":57500000.0,"debt":18302599168.0,"de":153.103,"eps":1.95,"feps":2.2576},"own":{"short":0.053200003,"inst":0.96222997,"insider":0.00336},"analyst":{"n":16,"mean":48.21875,"median":49.0,"high":52.0,"low":43.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.64706,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":10,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":10,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":9,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":9,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"HSBC","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":49.5,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":51.0,"priorPriceTarget":52.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":44.0,"priorPriceTarget":45.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"BMO Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":48.0,"priorPriceTarget":45.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-14","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Ac